    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Cats Visiting Fairy Tales</i>,</strong> a cozy clicker game where curious cats explore the enchanting realms of fantasy!<br>From magical schools and ancient spellbound towns to hidden elf villages, each of the five hand-drawn levels is bursting with charm, mystery, and\u2014of course\u2014cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission?<br>Find <strong>100 hidden cats</strong> in every level and uncover a <strong>unique special item</strong> hidden within each scene to complete your <strong>fairy tales collection</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With calming gameplay, delightful art, and a sprinkle of magic, <i>Cats Visiting Fairy Tale</i> is the perfect escape into a world where adventure and fluffiness meet.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Cats Visiting Fairy Tales</i>,</strong> a cozy clicker game where curious cats explore the enchanting realms of fantasy!<br>From magical schools and ancient spellbound towns to hidden elf villages, each of the five hand-drawn levels is bursting with charm, mystery, and\u2014of course\u2014cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission?<br>Find <strong>100 hidden cats</strong> in every level and uncover a <strong>unique special item</strong> hidden within each scene to complete your <strong>fairy tales collection</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With calming gameplay, delightful art, and a sprinkle of magic, <i>Cats Visiting Fairy Tale</i> is the perfect escape into a world where adventure and fluffiness meet.</p>",
    "short_description": "Step into a magical world and find all 500 hidden cats in 5 whimsical level! Explore enchanted schools, elf villages, and mystical towns in this charming fantasy clicker adventure. If it purrrrr it mewwww.",
